  "description": {
    "text": "Battle Festa 2014 was held in five cities in autumn 2014: at Act City Hamamatsu on 26 October, Sunshine City in Tokyo on 1 and 2 November, Kumamoto on 9 November, Intex Osaka on 16 November and Yume Messe Miyagi on 24 November. Every visitor got an original holo Pikachu and Gengar Spirit Link. Its tournament, the Victory Battle Gym MIX, was tied to the Pokémon Card Gym shops: their September and October gym battles gave a Special Entry Card worth an extra Play Point, and top finishers also won prizes for their gym. Two straight wins in the First Stage earned a Robo Substitute, three in the Second Stage a place in the Climax Stage, and the top three of each league each day won Victory Ring in gold, silver or bronze.",
